1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,525
I was going to quit that night.

2
00:00:02,525 --> 00:00:03,773
Keys on the dash.

3
00:00:03,773 --> 00:00:04,140
Done.

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,457
Tennessee, 2003.

5
00:00:06,457 --> 00:00:08,680
Three weeks from home.

6
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,884
My boy turned five that week.

7
00:00:11,884 --> 00:00:12,920
I missed it.

8
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:16,460
Two in the morning, I called
my dad from a payphone.

9
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,497
He'd driven a truck his whole life.

10
00:00:19,497 --> 00:00:21,900
I figured he'd tell me to come home.

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,660
He didn't say a word for a long time.

12
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,860
Then he said one sentence.

13
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,990
Twenty-three years later,
I'm still driving.

14
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,190
Full story's on the channel.

15
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,010
And that sentence...
